{"id": "22603", "title": "吕氏春秋", "author": "吕不韦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 26, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22603/22603s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/22/22603.htm", "intro": "《吕氏春秋》是战国末年（公元前“239”年前后）秦国丞相吕不韦组织属下门客们集体编撰的杂家著作，又名《吕览》。此书共分为十二纪、八览、六论，共十二卷，一百十六篇，二十余万字。在公元前239写成，当时正是秦国统一六国前夜。", "base": "files/article/html/22/22603", "chapters": [{"title": "孟春纪第一", "file": "1657294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "仲春纪第二", "file": "1657295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "季春纪第三", "file": "1657296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "孟夏纪第四", "file": "1657297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "仲夏纪第五", "file": "1657298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "季夏纪第六", "file": "1657299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "孟秋纪第七", "file": "1657300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "仲秋纪第八", "file": "1657301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "季秋纪第九", "file": "1657302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "孟冬纪第十", "file": "1657303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "仲冬纪第十一", "file": "1657304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "季冬纪第十二", "file": "1657305.html", "available": false}, {"title": "有始览第一", "file": "1657306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "孝行览第二", "file": "1657307.html", "available": false}, {"title": "慎大览第三", "file": "1657308.html", "available": true}, {"title": "先识览第四", "file": "1657309.html", "available": true}, {"title": "审分览第五", "file": "1657310.html", "available": true}, {"title": "审应览第六", "file": "1657311.html", "available": true}, {"title": "离俗览第七", "file": "1657312.html", "available": true}, {"title": "恃君览第八", "file": "1657313.html", "available": true}, {"title": "开春论第一", "file": "1657314.html", "available": true}, {"title": "慎行论第二", "file": "1657315.html", "available": true}, {"title": "贵直论第三", "file": "1657316.html", "available": true}, {"title": "不苟论第四", "file": "1657317.html", "available": true}, {"title": "似顺论第五", "file": "1657318.html", "available": true}, {"title": "士容论第六", "